{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122415","id":4281026728,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_K0io","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122415","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122415.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122415.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122415","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122415/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122415/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122415/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6d783b8734d36ce719c0023728d807a817ebee5c","number":122415,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Push error when class or member name hides global enums, constants or `Variant`","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Can close #111010\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI guess this would break compat, but having constants or enums or _`Variant`_ as class names is bound to lead to bugs and errors (like in the issue above). (I'm really not sure why `Variant` is allowed :p ) As for members, maybe there's more leeway, since they can be accessed through the class, but for principle, of course. If wanted, I can remove the restriction for members, though, if that would break compat for some projects (because they're already serialized for example). (Or just add a `not DISABLE_DEPRECATED` block around it)\r\n\r\nThis PR helped me realize that there was already global constants for `INT32_MIN`, `UINT32_MIN`, etc. so I didn't have to rely on a helper script for it. So I think it might be useful for some people.\r\n\r\nN/AI (I did my own research and code)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","de